WEBVTT

00:00:29.942 --> 00:00:33.446
limited road infrastructure, pollution,

00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:35.865
congestion and poor safety conditions.

00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:40.078
This makes it very difficult
for people to get to work,

00:00:40.078 --> 00:00:42.830
especially in low-income communities,

00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:47.126
where poverty infrastructure
gaps are pervasive.

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:51.214
Enter the African motorcycle taxi driver.

00:00:51.255 --> 00:00:53.299
Driving on two and three wheels,

00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:56.094
they race through the congested
streets of Africa,

00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:59.263
getting people and goods
to where they need to be.